            "url": "https://sdmx.oecd.org/public/rest/data/OECD.SDD.TPS,DSD_PRICES@DF_PRICES_ALL,1.0/NZL.Q.N.CPI.PA._TXCP01_NRG.N.GY?startPeriod={{startQuarter}}&format=csvfile",
            "description": "New Zealand publishes CPI quarterly only; values are never interpolated to monthly."
